{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006c","title":"曹操军摩陂亲重夏侯惇拜前将军还屯召陵","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006c-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"曹操军摩陂亲重夏侯惇拜前将军还屯召陵","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006c-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p003a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"夏侯惇请魏臣之礼曹操辞而终拜前将军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p003a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"亲重授官","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"受任移屯","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":219,"label":"建安二十四年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y219","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o019","basis":"建安二十四年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o006c-q","xiahoucao-q-o019","xiahoucao-q-b-9aecb5a185751b2b42bc"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o006c-q","source_order":[9,18,"O006c"],"order":2114}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0027","name":"夏侯惇","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o006c-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9b0ef46552fe5fa7e211","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年，太祖军（击破吕布军）于摩陂，召惇常与同载；特见亲重，出入卧内〖9〗。诸将莫得比也。拜前将军，﹝二﹞督诸军还寿春，徙屯召陵。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":94,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p003a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-8a141baf931dcebeeb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“时诸将皆受魏官号，惇独汉官，乃上疏自陈不当不臣之礼。太祖曰：‘吾闻太上师臣，其次友臣。夫臣者，贵德之人也；区区之魏，而臣足以屈君乎？’惇固请，乃拜为前将军。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c29db45bf992c014df6c","start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-9aecb5a185751b2b42bc","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9aecb5a185751b2b42bc","layer":"modern","quote":"〖9〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8745c758d8cce2516b2a","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o019","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4cfaf68cad6f0d5e3e1c","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年正月〖9〗，备夜烧围鹿角〖10〗；渊使张郃护东围，自将轻兵护南围。备挑郃战，郃军不利。渊分所将兵半，助郃；为备所袭，渊遂战死。谥曰愍侯。初，渊虽数战胜，太祖常戒曰：“为将当有怯弱时，不可但恃勇也〖11〗！将当以勇为本，行之以智计。但知任勇，一匹夫敌耳。”","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
